# Real school data - never commit (contains actual learner records)
**/700400012 Balmoral College*/
Top 10 automation/T3/
Top 10 automation/Output/
Annexure K automation/Output/

# Filled/submitted Annexure K workbooks contain real learner marks, and the
# R-7 template ships as a province-wide dump of every other school's
# name/EMIS number - only the small school-specific 8-12 templates are safe
# to keep as an example. The Top 10 template has no such issue.
Annexure K automation/*.xlsx
!Annexure K automation/*8-12 Template.xlsx

# Access database / lock files, wherever they end up
*.mdb
*.accdb
*.laccdb
*.ldb
~$*.xlsx

# Real database passwords - never commit
db_secret.py

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
